  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed roof extension, by virtue of its scale, height and siting, would create a visually dominating and out of character addition to no. 42A St. James Street, which would be unduly prominent when viewed from within the streetscene, reading as an outlier in the wider terrace row. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of the host building and row of 5 terraced properties. The proposal fails to comply with the design objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
